      "value": "- \"The canonical source for changelogs is Discord.\"\n\nCanonical change log is on Discord rather than the official website? That is counter-intuitive and completely opposite of common sense.\n\n- \"I would kindly ask to pose requests such as these on Discord, or simply give us some time to update our websites. Canny is not the place.\"\n\nGenerally, whenever feedback are posted in Discord they get a \"post on Canny otherwise they won't get followed up, Discord is not the place\", can you please clarify what should go where?",
